  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492540/diamond-spheres-harmony-and-discord?affiliate_id=3028400\">Diamond Spheres: Harmony &amp; Discord</a></sup></p>\n<p>Whenever you improve an ally’s AC using aid another, the bonus granted increases to +3. This increases by 1 per 10 ranks in the associated skill you possess.</p>\n<p>If you improve an ally’s AC using aid another, the aided ally also gains one of the following benefits against that opponent for the aid another effect’s duration:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The ally does not provoke attacks of opportunity from the opponent for standing up from prone, moving out of their threatened area, picking up an item, or drinking a potion.</li>\n<li>The ally is not considered flanked or flat-footed against the opponent.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Associated Feat:</strong> Got Your Back (<em>Melee Tactics Toolbox</em>)</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/communication#toc37\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
